<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 100,000 T optional durum - traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 100,000 T optional durum - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria is seeking to buy 100,000 tonnes of optional durum wheat for shipment in May and June, European grain traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Algeria has been in the market for durum since Tuesday but there was no word of a deal yet, they said.</p>
<p>&quot;They are in the market. We think they are close to making a purchase. But we have no confirmation yet,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
